    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/d2be67a0a96bdb6c0c80238401ab559b.avif?t=1751824432\" width=614 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The greatest infection in the world is love.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaylord took that phrase very seriously when, during his wedding, a giant syringe interrupted the ceremony and abducted all his friends and his fianc\u00e9e, Zoe...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A small infection in a needle&quot;</i> - the doctors said... but they had no idea what a true SIMP could do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/0c7a4d0f6d5658bcaf049a34160e01f5.avif?t=1751824432\" width=614 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel throughout the human body, annihilating hordes of enemies and overcoming normal obstacles and traps. A leg? An eye? The rectum? Of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/71f822234bb0b131330d0e1c8a8b2d8c.poster.avif?t=1751824432\" width=720 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/71f822234bb0b131330d0e1c8a8b2d8c.webm?t=1751824432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/71f822234bb0b131330d0e1c8a8b2d8c.mp4?t=1751824432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/c7920aa345cc50fcb1aac2db93bf7525.avif?t=1751824432\" width=614 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face numerous enemies, from simple Slimes, macrophages, and proteins to a dangerous tapeworm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/23021f23b979c808aba9236b4b8d96a5.poster.avif?t=1751824432\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/23021f23b979c808aba9236b4b8d96a5.webp?t=1751824432\" class=\"bb_img\" width=720 height=422 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/0067bbc7326443db57bb8bec66d27f0d.avif?t=1751824432\" width=614 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy over 20 weapons, 10 items, and 5 different buildings to customize your build and destroy the human body! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast-paced and frenetic matches that keep the adrenaline pumping!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect DNA to acquire weapons and upgrades between waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find chests and keys during waves to acquire instant powerups and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build your base from the ground and experiment with different structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Combine three weapons of the same type to maximize their power!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Utilize each character's unique abilities to gain a strategic advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face off against a variety of relentless enemies and bosses that will test your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy a wide selection of music while unleashing chaos within the human body!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/d2be67a0a96bdb6c0c80238401ab559b.avif?t=1751824432\" width=614 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The greatest infection in the world is love.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaylord took that phrase very seriously when, during his wedding, a giant syringe interrupted the ceremony and abducted all his friends and his fianc\u00e9e, Zoe...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A small infection in a needle&quot;</i> - the doctors said... but they had no idea what a true SIMP could do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/0c7a4d0f6d5658bcaf049a34160e01f5.avif?t=1751824432\" width=614 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel throughout the human body, annihilating hordes of enemies and overcoming normal obstacles and traps. A leg? An eye? The rectum? Of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/71f822234bb0b131330d0e1c8a8b2d8c.poster.avif?t=1751824432\" width=720 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/71f822234bb0b131330d0e1c8a8b2d8c.webm?t=1751824432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/71f822234bb0b131330d0e1c8a8b2d8c.mp4?t=1751824432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/c7920aa345cc50fcb1aac2db93bf7525.avif?t=1751824432\" width=614 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face numerous enemies, from simple Slimes, macrophages, and proteins to a dangerous tapeworm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/23021f23b979c808aba9236b4b8d96a5.poster.avif?t=1751824432\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/23021f23b979c808aba9236b4b8d96a5.webp?t=1751824432\" class=\"bb_img\" width=720 height=422 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836750/extras/0067bbc7326443db57bb8bec66d27f0d.avif?t=1751824432\" width=614 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy over 20 weapons, 10 items, and 5 different buildings to customize your build and destroy the human body! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast-paced and frenetic matches that keep the adrenaline pumping!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect DNA to acquire weapons and upgrades between waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find chests and keys during waves to acquire instant powerups and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build your base from the ground and experiment with different structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Combine three weapons of the same type to maximize their power!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Utilize each character's unique abilities to gain a strategic advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face off against a variety of relentless enemies and bosses that will test your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy a wide selection of music while unleashing chaos within the human body!</p></li></ul>",
